{"diagnosis": "Fetch test traps with TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000 and tohost FAIL 0xdead after 2009 cycles, expected advancing fetch addresses beyond 0x0. In picorv32.v:581-587 state 0 asserts mem_valid for mem_do_prefetch/mem_do_rinst/mem_do_rdata but picorv32.v:587 holds mem_state <= 0 instead of advancing, so the FSM never enters the wait-for-mem_ready state and no instruction ever completes. This self-loop is the single root cause of zero progress.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -581,7 +581,7 @@
 			case (mem_state)
 				0: begin
 					if (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst || mem_do_rdata) begin
 						mem_valid <= !mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word;
 						mem_instr <= mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst;
 						mem_wstrb <= 0;
-						mem_state <= 0;
+						mem_state <= 1;
", "expected": "tohost PASS with progress max_addr > 0x00000000 and no TRAP: no progress"}

